        "type": "single_choice",
        "question": "求最长严格上升子序列长度的 O(n²) DP 中，横线处应填入（　）。",
        "options": {
            "A": "dp[i] = max(dp[i], dp[j]);",
            "B": "dp[i] = max(dp[i+1], dp[j] + 1);",
            "C": "dp[i] = max(dp[i], dp[j] - 1);",
            "D": "dp[i] = max(dp[i], dp[j] + 1);"
        },
        "answer": "D",
        "explanation": "nums[i] > nums[j] 时，dp[i] 可由 dp[j] + 1 转移，取最大值。"
    },
